{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40847","headline":"咏手二首 二 · 赵光远","name":"咏手二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"捻玉搓琼软复圆，绿窗谁见上琴弦。\n慢笼彩笔闲书字，斜指瑶阶笑打钱。\n炉面试香添麝炷，舌头轻点贴金钿。\n象床珍簟宫棊处，拈定文楸占角边。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵光远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40847.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40847","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}